<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-1573] IGFS: mkdirs operations should be truly thread-safe</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-1573</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Need to lock all the existing parents and try to add the missing path in one transaction.&lt;br/&gt;
If failed due to concurrent creation, retry from the beginning.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
