                            <comment id="14939598" author="vozerov" created="Thu, 1 Oct 2015 09:52:38 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Ivan,&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I think that we should creation of each directory level can be performed in a single cache call instead of current &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;put + invoke&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;br/&gt;
Also it is better to move event recording out of transaction boundaries and IgfsMetaManager busy lock.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The rest looks good.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
